          <attvalue for="29" value="2" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="A sustained rise in long-term nominal yields raises financing and pension costs for firms and public bodies, prompting near-term cuts to IT/security operating budgets and reducing patching and monitoring, which increases the frequency and success of cyber exploits against AI systems." />
