          <attvalue for="33" value="-" />
          <attvalue for="29" value="3" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="0.8" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="Tightening in fixed‑income market liquidity raises short‑term funding and trade‑finance costs (commercial paper, repos and market‑making) used by shippers, freight forwarders and suppliers, forcing inventory cuts and payment delays that produce immediate logistical and supply‑chain interruptions." />
